      "text": "The Ruler persona frames the controversy around Christopher Nolan's 'Odyssey' adaptation as a threat to cultural order. The casting of Lupita Nyong'o as Helen of Troy and Clytemnestra triggered '煽动性的历史抹杀指控' from '混乱煽动者' and '秩序破坏者', whose '对传统叙事的激进解构' risks destabilizing public discourse. This '引发混乱的改编计划' via '具有争议的选角决定' has '煽动破坏性的在线攻击和文化战争', ultimately '将古典叙事卷入身份政治的混乱漩涡', demanding a restoration of authoritative control over narrative heritage.",
